      "block_id": "2605.00155_p15_b15",
      "text": "This is the baseline recipe to which our DRRO corrections will be compared. Everything\nthat follows keeps the grouped rollout, importance-ratio, and clipped policy-gradient\nbackbone of (4.2); only the reward signal inside the group changes. In particular, we do\nnot add any explicit KL penalty term to the policy objective.\n",
